Keep a shared word as empty text.
Place "aab" into word.
Keep a shared cuts as an empty list of whole numbers.
For every spot from 0 to 3.
Place spot into cuts.

Keep a shared pal as 0.
Set pal to 1.
To test from left (a whole number) with right (a whole number).
If left is at least right, return.
If character left of word is not character right of word, set pal to 0, return.
Test from left plus 1 with right minus 1.

To improve from finish (a whole number) with start (a whole number).
The candidate is item start of cuts plus 1.
If candidate is less than item finish of cuts, set item finish of cuts to candidate.

To relax from finish (a whole number) with start (a whole number).
If start is less than 0, return.
Set pal to 1.
Test from start with finish minus 1.
If pal is 1, improve from finish with start.
Relax from finish with start minus 1.

For every finish from 1 to 3.
Relax from finish with finish minus 1.

Show item 3 of cuts minus 1.
